<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48013" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεήλ-ᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαύνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>driven by a god</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεηλάτου βοὸς δίκην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1297
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. δαίμονες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.830f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sent</i> or <i>caused by a god</i>, of things evil in
			themselves or in their consequences, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθορή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.18
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον, πρᾶγμα, μάντευμα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				278
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OT</u>
				255
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				992
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόσους δ᾽ ἀνάγκη τὰς θ. φέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					680
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ τινος θεηλάτου</span> from
			some <i>destiny</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1392
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>built for the gods</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδραι</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1306
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
